      founder: "Carlos “Carlito” Fuente Jr (Tabacalera A. Fuente; through the wrapper development at the family’s own Château de la Fuente estate)",
      meaning: "From the Latin opus, meaning “a work, a great work”, joined with an “X”. Carlito relates that he came upon “opus” while hunting for “opulent” in a thesaurus, and the X is said to derive from the development code name “Project X from Planet 9”. For the doubling of the family name in the title, more than one explanation stands side by side",
